  lines:
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Nova
    text: "Your tech is now ours ! We\u2019ll teach you disco furries how to ACTUALLY
      pilot a Berserker well.\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'Huh? They managed to make a Berserker that quickly?! Recruit, you better
      have been paying attention on how to play the game, because things are going
      to get a lot harder!

      

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: "More seriously, don\u2019t panic! We have some NitroGroove at our disposal
      and we outnumber them.\r\n\n\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: "I\u2019m sure you\u2019ll find a solution, may the Groove be with you
      !\r\n\n\r\n"
